fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9259302Z Note: a multi-user installation is possible. See https://nix.dev/manual/nix/stable/installation/installing-binary.html#multi-user-installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9269379Z ^[[1;31mSwitching to the Multi-user Installer^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9379149Z ^[[32mWelcome to the Multi-User Nix Installation
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9390886Z ^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9393141Z This installation tool will set up your computer with the Nix package
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9393926Z manager. This will happen in a few stages:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9394324Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9395317Z 1. Make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix. If it does, I
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9396083Z    will show you instructions on how to clean up your old install.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9396567Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9396891Z 2. Show you what I am going to install and where. Then I will ask
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9397532Z    if you are ready to continue.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9397883Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9398495Z 3. Create the system users ^[[34m(uids [30001..30008])^[[0m and groups ^[[34m(gid 30000)^[[0m
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9399121Z    that the Nix daemon uses to run builds. To create system users
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9399670Z    in a different range, exit and run this tool again with
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9400059Z    NIX_FIRST_BUILD_UID set.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9400242Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9400436Z 4. Perform the basic installation of the Nix files daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9400702Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9400923Z 5. Configure your shell to import special Nix Profile files, so you
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9401341Z    can use Nix.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9401992Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9402121Z 6. Start the Nix daemon.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9402312Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9402638Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mWould you like to see a more detailed list of what I will do?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9403128Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9406187Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9406354Z I will:
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9406653Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9407331Z  - make sure your computer doesn't already have Nix files
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9408030Z    (if it does, I will tell you how to clean them up.)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9408695Z  - create local users (see the list above for the users I'll make)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9409272Z  - create a local group (nixbld)
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9409637Z  - install Nix in /nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9409951Z  - create a configuration file in /etc/nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9410699Z  - set up the "default profile" by creating some Nix-related files in
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9411339Z    /root
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9422647Z  - back up /etc/bash.bashrc to /etc/bash.bashrc.backup-before-nix
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9423651Z  - update /etc/bash.bashrc to include some Nix configuration
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9434867Z  - load and start a service (at /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.service
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9435466Z    and /etc/systemd/system/nix-daemon.socket) for nix-daemon
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9435895Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9437228Z ^[[32m^[[4;32mReady to continue?
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9437793Z ^[[0mNo TTY, assuming you would say yes :)
