fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9471129Z or maybe in a CI pipeline. Because of that, I'm going to skip the
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9471981Z verbose output in the interest of brevity.
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9472346Z 
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9472544Z If you would like to
fast	Run cachix/install-nix-action@v31.11.1	2026-10-08T20:02:50.9473003Z see the output, try like this:
